1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,609
01 / SSH PROFILE: Add a deployment host with its address, SSH port, username, and authentication.

2
00:00:09,609 --> 00:00:10,796
CONNECT: Save & connect opens the terminal. Credentials are not sent until the server key is trusted.

3
00:00:10,796 --> 00:00:17,265
VERIFY FINGERPRINT: Compare the Ed25519 SHA-256 fingerprint through a trusted channel before accepting.

4
00:00:17,265 --> 00:00:24,718
SSH TERMINAL: Connected as deploy on staging-web. Confirm the hostname and current load.

5
00:00:24,718 --> 00:00:29,281
02 / AI ASSISTANT: Open AI Assistant. The demo provider is already configured and tool-calling verified.

6
00:00:29,281 --> 00:00:38,343
SELECT TARGET: Use @ to target staging-web explicitly; the selected host scopes this request.

7
00:00:38,343 --> 00:00:44,203
RUN DIAGNOSTICS: The assistant checks disk space and service state before proposing a privileged change.

8
00:00:44,203 --> 00:00:50,062
REVIEW COMMAND: Review the host and exact command: sudo systemctl restart nginx. Approve only this command.

9
00:00:50,062 --> 00:00:56,765
VERIFY RESULT: After approval, Selai runs the command and the assistant verifies nginx again.

10
00:00:56,765 --> 00:01:01,687
COMPLETE: nginx is active; restart exit code is 0. The response includes disk usage and the target host.

11
00:01:01,687 --> 00:01:10,000
03 / PORT FORWARDING: Create an encrypted tunnel to reach a database through your SSH host.

12
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:20,828
MONITOR THE TUNNEL: 127.0.0.1:15432 reaches db.internal:5432. Inspect connections and traffic, or stop the tunnel.

13
00:01:20,828 --> 00:01:22,718
THREE TUNNEL MODES: Save local, remote, or dynamic SOCKS5 tunnels. Start each route only when needed.

14
00:01:22,718 --> 00:01:36,828
04 / PROXIES: Save reusable SOCKS5 or HTTP CONNECT routes for your SSH profiles.

15
00:01:36,828 --> 00:01:41,234
ASSIGN A ROUTE: Enable a proxy in the SSH profile. Terminal, AI, SFTP, and forwarding share this route.

16
00:01:41,234 --> 00:01:43,750
WORKSPACE READY: One workspace for SSH profiles, AI assistance, port forwarding, and proxies.
